---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ClientRouter } from 'astro:transitions';
import SignalGlobalStyles from '../components/direction-2/SignalGlobalStyles.astro';

import CursorGlow from '../components/direction-2/CursorGlow.tsx';
import SiteNav from '../components/direction-2/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/direction-2/SiteFooter.astro';
import WhatsAppButton from '../components/direction-2/WhatsAppButton.astro';
import SignalRuntime from '../components/direction-2/SignalRuntime.astro';

/* DRAFT for review — not legal advice. Items marked [TO CONFIRM] need an
   answer from One Search Pro before this page goes live. */
const updated = '[TO CONFIRM: date]';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — One Search Pro"
  description="How One Search Pro Marketing Sdn. Bhd. collects, uses and protects personal data under Malaysia's Personal Data Protection Act 2010."
  pageType="legal"
>
  <ClientRouter />
  <SignalGlobalStyles />

  <CursorGlow client:media="(pointer: fine)" />

  <div class="sig-atmos" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="sig-atmos__glow"></div>
    <div class="sig-atmos__grain"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sig-page">
    <SiteNav />
    <main id="main">
      <article class="sig-shell sig-legal">
        <p class="sig-meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>
        <h1 class="sig-h1">Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how One Search Pro Marketing Sdn. Bhd. ("One Search Pro", "we", "us") collects,
          uses, discloses and protects your personal data when you visit onesearchpro.my or contact us, in line with
          Malaysia's Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA).
        </p>

        <h2>1. Personal data we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Enquiry forms:</strong> your name, phone number, email address, the service you are interested in, and any message you write.</li>
          <li><strong>Direct contact:</strong> details you share when you WhatsApp, call or email us.</li>
          <li><strong>Job applications:</strong> details and documents you send to hr@onesearchpro.my.</li>
          <li><strong>Website usage:</strong> pages visited, links clicked, device and browser type, approximate location and referring website, collected through cookies and similar technologies (see section 5).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How we use your personal data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry and prepare proposals or quotations.</li>
          <li>To provide and manage the services you engage us for.</li>
          <li>To process job applications.</li>
          <li>To understand how our website is used and improve it.</li>
          <li>To measure and improve our advertising.</li>
          <li>To send you marketing communications, where you have agreed to receive them. You can opt out at any time.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal data. We share it only with service providers that help us run our business, who process it on our behalf:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Web3Forms, which delivers website form submissions to our inbox.</li>
          <li>Google (Google Workspace email, Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager and Google Ads).</li>
          <li>Meta Platforms (Meta Pixel, for measuring Facebook and Instagram advertising).</li>
          <li>Howuku, for anonymised website heatmaps.</li>
          <li>[TO CONFIRM: CRM or other tools that receive enquiry data, if any.]</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Some of these providers store data outside Malaysia. We may also disclose personal data where required by law.</p>

        <h2>4. How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>We keep personal data only as long as needed for the purposes above or as required by law. [TO CONFIRM: retention period for enquiries and job applications, e.g. 2 years.]</p>

        <h2>5. Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use cookies and similar technologies through Google Analytics, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and Howuku to count
          visits, understand which pages and links are used, and measure advertising. You can block or delete cookies in
          your browser settings; the website will still work.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
        <p>Under the PDPA you may:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>request access to the personal data we hold about you;</li>
          <li>ask us to correct personal data that is inaccurate, incomplete or out of date;</li>
          <li>withdraw your consent, or limit how we process your personal data, including for marketing.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Send requests to the contact below. We may charge a fee for access requests where the PDPA allows it.</p>

        <h2>7. Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable practical steps to protect personal data from loss, misuse and unauthorised access.</p>

        <h2>8. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          One Search Pro Marketing Sdn. Bhd.<br />
          No. 11-M, 11-1 &amp; 11-2, Jalan Manis 4, Taman Segar, 56100 Kuala Lumpur<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:info@onesearchpro.my">info@onesearchpro.my</a> · Phone: <a href="tel:+60330095621">03 3009 5621</a><br />
          [TO CONFIRM: person or role responsible for personal data enquiries.]
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version will always be on this page.</p>

        <p>[TO CONFIRM: The PDPA requires this notice in both Bahasa Malaysia and English. A Bahasa Malaysia version is still needed.]</p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </div>
  <WhatsAppButton />
  <SignalRuntime />
  <style>
    .sig-legal {
      max-width: 74ch;
      padding-top: clamp(8rem, 18vh, 11rem);
      padding-bottom: var(--sig-section);
      color: rgba(237, 237, 237, 0.78);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .sig-legal h1 { margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem; }
    .sig-legal h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 2.2rem 0 0.8rem; }
    .sig-legal p, .sig-legal ul { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    .sig-legal ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; list-style: disc; }
    .sig-legal a { color: var(--color-brand-accent); text-decoration: underline; }
    .sig-legal strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</Layout>
